# Stops a drag that would squeeze the elastic neighbour below its minimum, and gives the height back.
# The elastic neighbour is the sibling with kEFposnClient. It is found, not passed: scrEditor pays
# for the log panes, scrScript pays for scrResult.
Do pFieldRef.$container().$objs.$sendall(iTools.$setRef(clientRef,$sendallref),$sendallref.$edgefloat*1=kEFposnClient*1) Returns #1
If isclear(clientRef)
	# no elastic sibling - nothing pays, so nothing can be overdrawn
	Quit method
End If
Calculate diffHeight as clientRef.$minHeight-clientRef.$height
If diffHeight>0
	Sound bell
	Calculate pFieldRef.$height as pFieldRef.$height-diffHeight
End If